  "content": "<h1>HitPop</h1>\n<p>HitPop 是一款輕量的 Minecraft 戰鬥增強模組，為遊戲增添了動態浮動的傷害數字與針對不同武器的命中視覺效果。它旨在讓戰鬥體驗更具回應性與觸感，同時保持介面簡潔與效能優化。</p>\n<p>所有渲染均由客戶端使用 Minecraft 的現代化渲染系統處理，確保最大的相容性與流暢的效能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://media0.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExcWl5YTd4cWdpa2Zib2MzaDE2dzNieGxjc2Z6NnVwb3J0cXhyb2EwZiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/EywR7SxtwBfrFa1oKb/giphy.gif&n=-1\" alt=\"1\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://media4.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExcWo3aG5hY2c1dnFyZnVvaWtzdDM4emh2dGplZG9pemdka3NieWY2NiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/6XvoHbqVhlyht83PgM/giphy.gif&n=-1\" alt=\"2\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://media1.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExZjIzbXF5bHhubTBiMmoxNHRhc2IyMndwMjZjYTFzcDl3MTJhZXYyYiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/ZCbVUaPxrLZ9DrYX0e/giphy.gif&n=-1\" alt=\"3\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://media1.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExdzhlb2c1aTFlNXV1c2tmeGJjbnhlZ3lneWprd2M0cnVyN3F5bGVsdiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/N5xedDOxgLy2lm9smK/giphy.gif&n=-1\" alt=\"4\"></p>",
